    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to bring no.19 River View to the market. This well presented 4-bedroom detached property is ideally positioned in a quiet cul de sac in a boutique development of just 26 family homes. Built in 2023 this energy efficient home has been lavished with care and attention by its current owners.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hall, spacious living room, guest wc, fully fitted kitchen/dining area with a utility room off, and further living space with doors to a private rear garden. Upstairs there are 4 spacious bedrooms with a master ensuite and a family bathroom both with pressurised systems. The rear garden boasts a sunny west facing rear garden with a large patio and 2 side entrances.\r\nThere is an ample selection of schools nearby, and the property is convenient to Swords and all leisure, transport and shopping amenities. Dublin Airport and the M1 /M50 motorways are close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall 5.35 x 4.0 Decorative timber floor, spotlights, understairs storage, wired for alarm\r\n\r\nLiving Room 5.67 x 2.14 Decorative timber floor, spotlights\r\n\r\nGuest WC 1.65 x 1.55 Tiled floor, WC, WHB, large mirror, holders\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area 6.3 x 3.5 Fully fitted kitchen units with stone counter tops, oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, decorative timber floor\r\n\r\nFamily Room 4.0 x 3.0 Sliding door to rear garden\r\n\r\nUtility Room 1.7 x 1.7 Plumbed for washer/dryer, Panasonic boiler\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing Large landing, STIRA access to attic, hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 2.83 x 2.75 Carpeted floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 4.0 x 3.95 Carpeted floor, fitted wardrobe, tv point, light fitting\r\n\r\nFamily WC 2.4 x 2.0 Tiled floor&, partial walls, vanity unit, bath suite, shower screen, LED mirror, spotlights, handheld showerhead\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 4.20 x 3.35 Carpeted floor, fully fitted wardrobe, light fitting\r\n\r\nEnsuite 2.42 x 1.86 LED mirror, vanity unit, WC, WHB, tiled floor, partially tiled walls, walk in shower, waterfall showerhead\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 2.8 x 2.63 Carpeted floor, light fitting\r\n\r\nGarden West facing, electrical socket, light, tap, 2x side passage, patio, lawn, fenced, timber garden shed with lights and sockets"
      },
